 barricade rules required by Austin Energy.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md:*   **Blocks 14 & 18:** Electric Notes and Austin Energy standard requirements. READ for tree pruning, easement access, and code compliance constraints.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md:- `block-8.md` — text_block: List of 5 notes regarding electric utilities, specifically referencing Austin Energy's requirements \n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-03/guide.md:- `block-14.md` — text_block: Additional notes outlining requirements from Austin Energy regarding easements, tree work, erosion c\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-04/blocks.md:- - TRANSFORMER ON PAD\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-34/blocks.md:## Block 1: diagram — Drawing of the critical root zone impact for tree 4038H. Shows the location of existing trees to be preserved, proposed driveway, existing pavement to be removed, proposed building, proposed sidewalk, and proposed transformer.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-34/blocks.md:PROPOSED TRANSFORMER\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-34/blocks.md:## Block 2: diagram — Drawing and photograph of the critical root zone impact for tree 4034. Shows the location of existing trees to be preserved, proposed building, proposed transformer, proposed sidewalk, retaining wall, and proposed curb.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-34/blocks.md:PROPOSED TRANSFORMER\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-34/guide.md:*   **Block 1**: Diagram and photograph — Critical Root Zone Impact Tree 4034. Use VISION to examine the spatial relationship and impact zones between the existing tree and the proposed building, transformer, retaining wall, and 1' wall construction overbuild. \n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-33/blocks.md:## Block 1: drawing — Plan drawing showing the canopy impact for tree 4038H, including existing trees to be preserved, proposed building, proposed driveway, proposed sidewalk, proposed transformer, and a photograph of the existing tree.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-33/blocks.md:[Drawing showing the canopy of tree 4038H intersecting with a proposed building and other site features. Callouts indicate 'PROPOSED SIDEWALK', 'PROPOSED TRANSFORMER', '4' OVERBUILD OFFSET', 'TREE CANOPY OVERLAP, TYP.', 'PROPOSED BUILDING', 'PROPOSED CURB', 'PROPOSED DRIVEWAY', 'MAPPED TREE CANOPY', and 'EXISTING TREES - TO BE PRESERVED (4039 TO BE MITIGATED IN PLACE)'. Topographic contour lines and other existing features are also shown.]\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md:*   **Block 4**: Plan drawing and calculations for Canopy Impact Tree 4038H. READ for canopy calculations and the specific note regarding Tree 4039 (\"to be mitigated in place\"); Use VISION to observe the spatial overlap with the proposed driveway, curb, and transformer.\n/Users/wnavey/code/controlroom/conductor/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md:   L