 to the on-site utility pole mentioned above. From this on-site pole, a line continues West across the front driveway area, connecting to the North-South line running along Valley View Road.\n*   **Crossing the Property (North-South):** A dashed line runs South from the on-site utility pole, crossing the southern property boundary (`S63°03'28\"E 419.96'`) to connect to the off-site pole located in \"LOT A CORTEZ HEIGHTS\".\n\n### 3. Labels and Notations\nThe following specific text labels on the drawing indicate the presence of overhead electrical facilities:\n\n*   **Line Labels:** The dashed lines described above are repeatedly labeled directly on the line itself with the text:\n    `O.H. ELECTRIC`\n*   **Easement Notations:** There are specific easements labeled on the drawing that appear to correspond with the path of the overhead electrical infrastructure in the southern portion of the site.\n    *   Near the East-West line crossing the south side of the property, a label reads:\n        `10' ELEC. EASEMENT`\n        `VOL. 6464, PG. 74`\n        `P.R.T.C.TX.`\n    *   Near the Southwest corner, adjacent to where the overhead lines run, a label reads:\n        `5' ELEC. EASEMENT`\n        `VOL. 5048, PG. 888`\n        `D.R.T.C.TX.`","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAtt