{"level":30,"time":1776703449099,"pid":50886,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_018t7EodKLHv1NBftfMXi5P8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I have detailed information about the electric transmission notes. Key findings:\n\n**From Sheet 3 Block 20 (Electric Transmission Notes):**\n1. No trees within transmission easement or within 25 feet of transmission structure base\n2. No digging/grading within 25 feet of transmission structures\n3. 48-hour pre-construction safety meeting required with Austin Energy\n4. OSHA requires 20-foot clearance from energized transmission lines during construction (working clearance)\n5. Barricades must be erected 10 feet from transmission structures during construction\n6. 20-foot clearance for aerial equipment, dumpsters, staging areas from transmission wires/structures\n7. Must maintain 24-hour access to electric facilities\n8. Warning signs required under overhead transmission facilities\n9. 20-foot minimum distance for fire hydrants from transmission structures\n10. Sprinklers prohibited within 25 feet of transmission poles\n11. No structures placed in easement that would violate NESC\n12. Owner not allowed to place structures that would impair Austin Energy's access\n\n**From Sheet 3 Block 8 & 14 (Electric Notes):**\n- Developer responsible for tree pruning within 10 feet of proposed overhead electrical facilities\n- Easements and access required for installation and maintenance of overhead and underground electric facilities\n- Relocation costs at owner's expense\n\nNow I need to examine the actual site plan (Sheet 9) and landscape plan to see what's shown regarding the overhead lines and how the development relates to them. Let me check the blocks.md for Sheet 9.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3551,"cache_read_input_tokens":52099,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3551},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b2822d9-59e1-40b7-8c44-f04e0d31c7f2","uuid":"b2b4b9a6-24ac-44f0-ad1a-668da637ec71"}
