{"level":30,"time":1776703449102,"pid":50886,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Based on this site plan, can you identify: 1) The location of the overhead utility poles and lines shown on the existing conditions survey (Sheet 4) in relation to the 8 proposed buildings (Buildings 1-8). 2) Are there any overhead utility lines shown crossing over or through the proposed building areas? 3) What is the approximate location of any overhead lines relative to the buildings? 4) Are there any dimension callouts or clearance annotations shown between buildings and any overhead utilities?","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided site plan (identified as Sheet 9 of 39 in the bottom right corner), here are the findings regarding your questions:\n\n1.  **Location of overhead utility poles and lines:** An overhead utility line is visible on this plan, denoted by a dashed line with the text label **\"- OHE -\"** integrated into it. This line runs laterally along the southernmost property boundary of the site. Relative to the 8 proposed buildings, this line is located to the south of **Bldg. 8**, **Bldg. 7**, and **Bldg. 6**. There are no overhead utility lines shown near Buildings 1, 2, 3, 4, or 5, which are located further north.\n2.  **Overhead lines crossing building areas:** Based on this drawing, there are **no** overhead utility lines shown crossing over or through any of the proposed building footprints (Bldg. 1 through Bldg. 8).\n3.  **Approximate location relative to buildings:** The overhead lines run exclusively along the southern perimeter of the site. They remain entirely outside of the proposed building areas, running roughly parallel to the southern property boundary, directly south of the rear boundaries of Buildings 8, 7, and 6.\n4.  **Dimension callouts or clearance annotations:** A close review of the area between the proposed buildings and the \"- OHE -\" line reveals **no** specific dimension lines, callouts, or text annotations that indicate the clearance or distance between the buildings and the overhead utility lines on this specific sheet.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1415,"outputTokens":330,"totalTokens":4081,"reasoningTokens":2336},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2702484]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant information that pertains to the broader request. Remember that you are only looking at a single supplementary document, or a single page from the primary site plan. Just because you do not find evidence for a requirement on this page does not mean it will not be present on another page.\n\nReport back precisely on what you see, using exact quotes for any text you transcribe from forms, tables, or labels.\n\nThe final review agent will not be able to look at this document directly, so you must be their eyes. Ensure you describe everything relevant in full detail with perfect accuracy.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Based on this site plan, can you identify: 1) The location of the overhead utility poles and lines shown on the existing conditions survey (Sheet 4)