), the physical layout of the irrigation system is not depicted on this specific sheet, which is titled \"LANDSCAPE PLAN\".","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1412,"outputTokens":672,"totalTokens":4151,"reasoningTokens":2067},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":853409.760716,"endTime":893914.42068,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"AFjmaaX6H_WDh-cPtf7FyAM"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.035692","marketCost":"0.035692","inferenceCost":"0.035692","inputInferenceCost":"0.002824","outputInferenceCost":"0.032868","generationId":"gen_01KPNWFG8TR3YH8YBZ7G1THERQ"}}},"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided Landscape Plan, here are the findings regarding your specific questions:\n\n**(1) Whether the overhead electric line is shown:**\nYes, an overhead electric line is shown on the plan. It runs along the bottom edge (southern property boundary) of the site plan and is depicted by a solid line interrupted by the label **\"- OHE -\"**.\n\n**(2) What trees or other plants are sh