lls as fire exits - need to check floor plans\n- EL-13.9: Fire escapes - need to check building elevations\n- EL-13.11: Confined space/niches - need to check if any transformers are in niches\n- EL-13.13: Trees utility-compatible - need to check landscape plan\n- EL-13.14: Shrub clearances - need to check landscape plan\n- EL-13.15: Root barriers - need to check landscape plan\n- EL-13.16: Dumpsters - need to check site plan\n- EL-13.17: Bike racks - need to check site plan\n- EL-13.18: Light poles - need to check site plan\n- EL-13.19: Fire lanes - measured via vision, need to measure distances\n- EL-13.24: Gas lines - need to check utility plan\n- EL-13.25: 12-inch clear ances from other utilities - need to check utility plans\n- EL-13.26: Not over/under other utilities - need to check utility plans\n- EL-13.27: 7.5-foot from overhead distribution - need to check utility plan\n- EL-13.28: 15-foot radius from overhead conductors - need to check utility plan\n- EL-13.29: 35-foot vertical in niches - not applicable unless niches present\n- EL-13.30: 3-hour fire rating in niches - not applicable unless niches present\n\nNow I should review the Plat sheet to understand property boundaries and easements, then cross-reference the utility plans for proper separations and overhead line clearances.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3841,"cache_read_input_tokens":64660,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3841},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9fa6dd19-b9c0-47f2-aaf9-fa9fde6b7270","uuid":"74ff9b72-56bc-40bb-9e39-10704b55d2bd"}
