erhead electric line and trees are proposed; throughout site for underground electrical infrastructure"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Trees and electric facilities shown on separate plan sheets without clear cross-reference or dimensional relationship. Landscape plan (Sheet 31) shows overhead electric line along southern boundary but does not dimensionally relate tree planting locations to this infrastructure. Underground electrical infrastructure (Sheet 21) showing transformers and pull boxes is not referenced on the landscape plan, preventing clear verification of tree clearances from all electric equipment as required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-2.15","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["Southeast property corner and southern property boundary where trees are proposed near overhead electric facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":35}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Plans propose trees near overhead electric facilities (southeast tree measured at 10 feet from pole), but no documented written approval from Austin Energy is visible on the plans, in notes, or in supplementary documents. Cannot verify whether any exceptions to tree clearance requirements have been explicitly approved by Austin Energy as required by UCM § 1.10.10.4."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8ac24b0d-77a5-489e-b33c-7dd8f6a1adda"}
