n the west side connecting to \"Valley View Road (60' R.O.W.)\". This entrance leads to a continuous, 26-foot-wide loop road (designated as the Fire Lane) that navigates around the central buildings and provides access to all eight buildings on the site. Corners feature marked turning radii (e.g., R40, R25) to accommodate apparatus turning.\n*   **Transformer Interference:** Because there are no transformers identified or labeled on this specific site plan document, there is **no visual evidence on this page that transformers will interfere** with fire apparatus access routes or turnaround requirements.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":5121455.962665,"endTime":5151445.531271,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"g1_mab3bFY_c6tgPre7u4Qs"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.04082","marketCost":"0.04082","inferenceCost":"0.04082","inputInferenceCost":"0.002768","outputInferenceCost":"0.038052","generationId":"gen_01KPNYA5KZZK5RDG2AAAAQ029G"}}}]},"msg":"Vision response"}
