 items - NEED TO CHECK\n\nI should prioritize the most likely applicable items. The utility poles along Valley View Road are critical—I need to verify whether the driveways crossing underneath meet the 30-foot requirement and check if water meters or other utilities conflict with the pole locations.\n\nFor the sidewalk situation, I should examine whether any are positioned at the poles near the property boundaries. The overhead distribution line appears to pass over the driveway entrances rather than over permanent structures, though I want to confirm this visually to rule out any violations related to facilities placement.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1464,"cache_read_input_tokens":77884,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1464},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d43314f-ffee-4c09-9531-73169237fb4a","uuid":"a6ca2dd7-7eb3-44c2-9d95-38f2e444a69f"}
