{"level":30,"time":1776705784639,"pid":50886,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01NwkWw6CzLrncaLxPD3ptHx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I have completed my comprehensive review of the EL-13 grouping (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements). \n\n## Summary of Findings\n\nI conducted a thorough site plan review and identified:\n\n### **1 FAIL Item:**\n- **EL-13.32**: Critical drainage issue - Grading plan shows drainage flowing from the east-central transformer pad (between Buildings 4 & 5) toward Building 5's foundation. For oil-filled equipment, liquid must flow AWAY from buildings. This violates UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 1.\n\n### **8 NOT-VERIFIABLE Items:**\nThese deficiencies could not be verified due to missing information:\n- **EL-13.4**: No AE Design written approval documented for any clearance reductions\n- **EL-13.10**: Access door orientation and hot-stick use areas not depicted\n- **EL-13.13**: Transformers not identified on landscape plan; cannot verify tree species or location compliance  \n- **EL-13.14**: Cannot verify shrub/vegetation clearances without transformer locations on landscape plan\n- **EL-13.15**: Cannot verify root barrier requirements without transformer identification\n- **EL-13.31**: No cross-section drawings showing vertical clearances\n- **EL-13.35**: Transformer easements not shown; boundaries and width cannot be verified\n- **EL-13.37**: No AE Design transformer pad detail sheets provided with specifications\n- **EL-13.38**: No bollard or protective barrier details shown for transformers near parking areas\n\n### **30 PASS Items** (not included in findings output per instructions):\nThese items met requirements, including minimum clearances from buildings (measured 8.3-19.5 ft), sidewalks (6.8-15.6 ft), and proper location on private property.\n\nThe findings have been returned in the structured format for processing."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2788,"cache_read_input_tokens":79331,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2788},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dccfafa3-f785-4cc2-a45b-b26d9e2e76f8","uuid":"51b9ca4c-ed7b-4c44-a5b4-ce036086102c"}
