{"level":30,"time":1776705814429,"pid":50886,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Looking at this site plan, please answer: 1) Are there any building footprints, parking structures, or permanent structures shown directly under, over, or intersecting with the overhead utility line (OHE) shown on the plan? 2) At the points where the OHE line crosses the western property boundary near Valley View Road, are there sidewalks shown? 3) Are sidewalks shown at both ends of the property along the Valley View Road frontage, particularly where the utility poles are located?","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a precise visual analysis of the provided site plan, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n**1) Are there any building footprints, parking structures, or permanent structures shown directly under, over, or intersecting with the overhead utility line (OHE) shown on the plan?**\n\nNo. Based on the site plan, there are no building footprints (labeled \"Bldg. 1\" through \"Bldg. 8\") or parking bay structures shown directly intersecting, under, or over the overhead utility lines (labeled \"- OHE -\").\n*   The \"- OHE -\" lines are routed along the outer western boundary (Valley View Road) and the southern boundary of the property.\n*   While the OHE lines do not intersect buildings or parking spaces, they do intersect surface-level infrastructure, specifically crossing over the proposed driveways (labeled \"Construct Type III Driveway\") and proposed sidewalk areas along the western boundary. They also run in close proximity to, or over, proposed retaining walls (e.g., \"Begin Concrete Retaining Wall\" at the bottom right and bottom left).\n\n**2) At the points where the OHE line crosses the western property boundary near Valley View Road, are there sidewalks shown?**\n\nYes. Where the \"- OHE -\" line runs along and crosses the western property boundary near Valley View Road, it intersects with areas explicitly designated as sidewalks.\n*   Near the northernmost driveway entrance on the west side, the OHE line crosses directly over a hatched rectangular path labeled **\"Construct 5' Concrete Sidewalk See Dtl 432S-1\"**.\n*   Moving south along that western boundary, the OHE line runs parallel to and crosses over sections of a similarly hatched path labeled **\"Sidewalk Easement\"**.\n\n**3) Are sidewalks shown at both ends of the property along the Valley View Road frontage, particularly where the utility poles are located?**\n\nNo, sidewalks are not shown extending to the absolute ends of the property frontage near the utility poles on *both* sides.\n*   **Northern end (Top Left):** Yes. There is a cluster of utility infrastructure (poles/manholes) near the top left corner of the property boundary. The hatched path labeled **\"Construct 5' Concrete Sidewalk See Dtl 432S-1\"** is shown extending to this northern property line near the poles.\n*   **Southern end (Bottom Left):** No. There is a utility pole shown at the very bottom-left corner of the property boundary where the OHE lines turn. However, the shaded sidewalk path along the western frontage is shown terminating at the northern edge of the lower **\"Construct Type III Driveway\"**. The plan does not show the shaded sidewalk hatching continuing south of this driveway to reach the utility pole at the southern corner of the property.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1410,"outputTokens":588,"totalTokens":4589,"reasoningTokens":2591},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2702484]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary f